  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e95750f108e433543aef0099027763ad, type: 3}
  m_Name: brno-intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  entryLines:
  - text: "Vypad\xE1 to, \u017Ee jsme vykolejili. Hmm, sp\xED\u0161e dokolejili."
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "Jsi v pohod\u011B?"
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "Samoz\u0159ejm\u011B. \u0160t\u011Bst\u011Bna je na m\xE9 stran\u011B.
      M\xE1 u n\xE1s pivo na \xFA\u010Det podniku."
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "D\xE1l voz\xEDkem asi nepojedeme. M\xE1me ale \u0161t\u011Bst\xED, jsme
      velmi bl\xEDzko Brnu."
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "Jak to pozn\xE1\u0161?"
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "Nepozn\xE1v\xE1\u0161 \u0159eku Starobrnku prot\xE9kaj\xEDc\xEDm podzem\xEDm
      moravsk\xE9ho krasu?"
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  - text: "No tak to f\xE1kt ne... Nu\u017Ee, vzh\u016Fru do pr\xE1ce."
    speakerName: Branice
  - text: "Je\u0161t\u011B posledn\xED v\u011Bc Branice. Pokud bys n\xE1hodou zapomn\u011Bla,
      k \u010Demu kter\xE1 kl\xE1vesa slou\u017E\xED, sta\u010D\xED stisknout tla\u010D\xEDtko
      Esc a v nastaven\xED ovl\xE1d\xE1n\xED najde\u0161 v\u0161echny pot\u0159ebn\xE9
      informace."
    speakerName: "Kry\u0161tof"
  choices: []
  participantPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: acbefb7de517d05429e8f76e1b6e54a5, type: 3}
  monologue: 0
